 classify every empty region or broken editorial image as an animation.", "regenerated_purpose_requirements": "For regenerated pages, coherent text-only news or event cards are allowed. Do not infer a broken image merely from an unillustrated card or empty stylistic space. A source illustration need not be reproduced. Cropped illustrative poster imagery is not material loss when its title, date and essential information remain available as legible page text. Reject observable broken resources, unintelligible essential information or unusable actual controls; do not reject a usable target simply for sparse imagery, a different design or optional source omissions.", "page_purpose_outline": {"instruction": "These saved DOM headings clarify the whole-page purpose, including sections outside this visual window. Card image elements and decorative placeholders describe the saved structure, not successful image loading. A text-only card without an image element is not a broken image. These records are not proof that target text is visible. Assess actual legibility and material loss from the screenshots. Regenerated sections may appear in a different order and layout.", "sources": [{"role": "reference", "sha256": "3e0a694fdfeeb1a2d1cd627721a9e9b32a59e3d195bae8b7221446e307e02494", "headings": [{"level": "h1", "text": "Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue. Accept payments, offer financial services, and implement custom revenue models—from your first transaction to your billionth."}, {"level": "h1", "text": "Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue. Accept payments, offer financial services, and implement custom revenue models—from your first transaction to your billionth."}, {"level": "h2", "text": "Flexible solutions for every business model."}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Accept and optimize payments globally—online and in person"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Enable any billing model"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Monetize through agentic commerce"}, {"level": "h3", "t